{"sha": "edfcd8ddddfe687be67393dd34e589ac91dc8c0b679f998145831dc66e276eb2", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:coordgeom} 章 --- 坐标几何}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:1}", "中点：$\\left(\\frac{2 + (-4)}{2}, \\frac{5 + 1}{2}\\right) = (-1, 3)$。", "距离：", "\\[", "AB = \\sqrt{(-4 - 2)^2 + (1 - 5)^2} = \\sqrt{36 + 16} = \\sqrt{52}", "= 2\\sqrt{13}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:2}", "$I$ 为 $[AB]$ 的中点，即 $\\frac{3 + x_B}{2} = 1$ 且", "$\\frac{-2 + y_B}{2} = 2$，于是 $x_B = -1$，$y_B = 6$，即 $B(-1, 6)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:3}", "$OP = \\sqrt{16 + 1} = \\sqrt{17}$; $OQ = \\sqrt{9 + 4} = \\sqrt{13}$;", "$OR = \\sqrt{0 + 25} = 5 = \\sqrt{25}$。因 $13 < 17 < 25$，", "且平方根函数递增，故 $Q$ 离原点最近。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:4}", "边长的平方：", "\\begin{align*}", "AB^2 &= (5-1)^2 + (4-2)^2 = 16 + 4 = 20, \\\\", "BC^2 &= (7-5)^2 + (0-4)^2 = 4 + 16 = 20, \\\\", "AC^2 &= (7-1)^2 + (0-2)^2 = 36 + 4 = 40 .", "\\end{align*}", "$AB = BC$，故三角形在 $B$ 处为等腰三角形。此外", "$AB^2 + BC^2 = 40 = AC^2$，由勾股定理的逆定理，", "三角形在 $B$ 处也是直角三角形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:5}", "\\emph{1.} $[AC]$ 的中点为", "$\\left(\\frac{-2+4}{2}, \\frac{1+1}{2}\\right) = (1, 1)$；$[BD]$ 的中点为", "$\\left(\\frac{1+1}{2}, \\frac{3+(-1)}{2}\\right) = (1, 1)$。两中点相同，", "故 $ABCD$ 为平行四边形。", "", "\\emph{2.} $AB^2 = 3^2 + 2^2 = 13$，$BC^2 = 3^2 + (-4)^2 = 25$，", "则 $AB \\neq BC$，不是菱形。", "", "\\emph{3.} $AC^2 = 6^2 + 0^2 = 36$，$BD^2 = 0^2 + (-4)^2 = 16$，", "则 $AC \\neq BD$，不是矩形。$ABCD$ 只是一般的平行四边形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:6}", "计算各点到 $\\Omega(2,1)$ 的距离平方，并与 $5^2 = 25$ 比较：", "\\[", "\\Omega A^2 = 3^2 + 4^2 = 25, \\qquad", "\\Omega B^2 = (-3)^2 + (-4)^2 = 25, \\qquad", "\\Omega C^2 = 4^2 + 1^2 = 17 .", "\\]", "$A$、$B$ 在圆上；$C$ 在圆内（$17 < 25$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:7}", "$MA^2 = (x - 1)^2 + 1$，$MB^2 = (x - 7)^2 + 25$。令", "$MA^2 = MB^2$：", "\\[", "x^2 - 2x + 2 = x^2 - 14x + 74", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "12x = 72", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "x = 6 .", "\\]", "满足条件的点唯一，为 $M(6, 0)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:8}", "\\emph{1.} $I = \\left(\\frac{0+4}{2}, \\frac{3+1}{2}\\right) = (2, 2)$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $M(2,2)$ 确为 $I$。", "又 $MA^2 = (0-2)^2 + (3-2)^2 = 5$，$MB^2 = (4-2)^2 + (1-2)^2 = 5$，", "可见中点到两端点距离相等，与预期相符。", "", "\\emph{3.} 求 $N(0, y)$，使 $NA^2 = NB^2$：", "\\[", "(3 - y)^2 = 16 + (1 - y)^2", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "9 - 6y = 16 + 1 - 2y", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "-4y = 8,", "\\]", "于是 $y = -2$，即点 $N(0, -2)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:9}", "\\begin{align*}", "AB &= \\sqrt{4^2 + 2^2} = \\sqrt{20} = 2\\sqrt5, \\\\", "BC &= \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt5, \\\\", "AC &= \\sqrt{12^2 + 6^2} = \\sqrt{180} = 6\\sqrt5 .", "\\end{align*}", "于是 $AB + BC = 2\\sqrt5 + 4\\sqrt5 = 6\\sqrt5 = AC$，", "故三角形不等式取等号，$B$ 位于线段 $[AC]$ 上 ---", "三点共线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:coordgeom:10}", "$[AB]$ 的中点为 $I\\left(\\frac a2, \\frac b2\\right)$。于是", "\\[", "OI^2 = \\frac{a^2}{4} + \\frac{b^2}{4},", "\\qquad", "IA^2 = \\left(a - \\frac a2\\right)^2 + \\left(0 - \\frac b2\\right)^2", "= \\frac{a^2}{4} + \\frac{b^2}{4},", "\\]", "同理 $IB^2 = \\left(0 - \\frac a2\\right)^2 + \\left(b - \\frac b2\\right)^2 =", "\\frac{a^2}{4} + \\frac{b^2}{4}$。三者的平方距离相等，", "故 $OI = IA = IB$，即直角三角形 $OAB$ 斜边的中点", "与三个顶点等距（它是", "其外接圆的圆心）。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}